<title>USA: Florsheim says CFO resigning.</title>
<headline>Florsheim says CFO resigning.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florsheim Shoe Co said chief financial officer Larry Svoboda is resigning to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>A replacement was not named.</p>
<p>Svoboda had been CFO of the shoe retailer since 1987, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
